\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textsc  {Prospect}{}. The encoder embedding $e_t$ enters only the posterior. One decoder and every head read $\mathrm  {feat}_t=[h_t, z_t]$. The field head predicts a material and an object class for each of $C$ cells around the agent. The actor reads $\mathrm  {feat}_t$ and a field $\phi _t$. In imagination, $\phi _t$ is the field head's softmax on $[h_t,z^{\mathrm  {prior}}_t]$. On real steps in every reported run, $\phi _t$ is the environment's field (dashed).\relax }}{4}{figure.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{2}{4}{\method {}. The encoder embedding $e_t$ enters only the posterior. One decoder and every head read $\mathrm {feat}_t=[h_t, z_t]$. The field head predicts a material and an object class for each of $C$ cells around the agent. The actor reads $\mathrm {feat}_t$ and a field $\phi _t$. In imagination, $\phi _t$ is the field head's softmax on $[h_t,\zprior _t]$. On real steps in every reported run, $\phi _t$ is the environment's field (dashed).\relax }{figure.caption.13}{}}
\newlabel{fig:architecture@cref}{{[figure][2][]2}{[1][4][]4}}
