\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The two conditions on the benchmark, 100k environment steps each, one seed each, all from the same starting checkpoint. \emph  {Lives}: training lives after excluding the three per run that were open during a demonstrator injection (\cref  {app:inject}). \emph  {Teacher finishes}: lives in which the demonstrator, given control after the actor crafted a stone pickaxe, went on to craft the iron pickaxe, out of all such handoffs. \emph  {Actor, unaided}: lives with no handoff in which the actor crafted the iron pickaxe. \emph  {Held-out}: iron pickaxes in ten actor-only lives at 0, 25k, 50k, 75k, and 100k steps.\relax }}{8}{table.caption.26}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:switches}{{2}{8}{The two conditions on the benchmark, 100k environment steps each, one seed each, all from the same starting checkpoint. \emph {Lives}: training lives after excluding the three per run that were open during a demonstrator injection (\cref {app:inject}). \emph {Teacher finishes}: lives in which the demonstrator, given control after the actor crafted a stone pickaxe, went on to craft the iron pickaxe, out of all such handoffs. \emph {Actor, unaided}: lives with no handoff in which the actor crafted the iron pickaxe. \emph {Held-out}: iron pickaxes in ten actor-only lives at 0, 25k, 50k, 75k, and 100k steps.\relax }{table.caption.26}{}}
